  "description": "Molecular model of circadian rhythm oscillator. Shows CLOCK-BMAL1, PER-CRY feedback loops that generate 24-hour cycles. Based on Goldbeter (1995) and Nobel Prize 2017 research. Reference: Strogatz, S. H. (2015). Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos. Westview Press. Source: https://doi.org/10.1201/9780429492563",
